'''Naasioi''' (also '''Nasioi''', '''Kieta''', '''Kieta Talk''', '''Aunge''') is an [[East Papuan languages|East Papuan language]] spoken in the central mountains and southeast coast of [[Kieta District]], [[Bougainville Province]], [[Papua New Guinea]].

